QNTAB='Open the Notifications page from the bell and select the Quick notes tab.'
def seed_qn(): return ('Seed a quick note: on the Quick notes tab click New quick note, type a Name (e.g. "Waiting on parts") '
    'and a body (e.g. "Vehicle is waiting on parts; will update the customer."), and Create.')

